{
  "slug": "curried-prawn-salad",
  "title": "Curried Prawn Salad",
  "blurb": "A quick, no-cook salad with prawns tossed in a mild curry dressing, served over crisp lettuce with cucumber and tomatoes.",
  "steps": [
    "Pat the cooked prawns dry with kitchen paper and place in a large mixing bowl.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the Greek yoghurt, mayonnaise, curry powder, lemon juice and olive oil until smooth.",
    "Dice the cucumber and halve the cherry tomatoes, then add them to the prawns.",
    "Finely slice the spring onions and stir them into the prawn mixture.",
    "Pour the curry dressing over the prawns and vegetables, then toss gently until everything is well coated.",
    "Separate the lettuce leaves, arrange them on a serving platter, and spoon the curried prawn mixture over the top."
